Subject: Cantor M2B Windows Sys Direct Feature and ABI Compile Probe Plan

& [PlanIdentity] is the authorized work order
  + [plan_uuid] is f98dac78-a201-49e3-ba26-edb84805d72c
  + [solution_uuid] is 500dfdff-fee7-4c38-bcdd-af5ea25522bf
  + [signature_uuid] is 636448aa-295d-486e-ba3c-d1b4f12cd264
  + [status] is ready

& [Stage1] is dependency baseline
  + [action] record workspace Cargo, ecosystem Cargo, Cargo.lock, and package-count baselines
  + [action] verify locked package checksum and generated-source hash

& [Stage2] is exact Cargo revision
  + [action] add cfg(windows) dependency with version =0.61.2, default-features false, and three exact features
  + [action] run locked Cargo resolution
  + [gate] Cargo.lock SHA-256 and package count remain exact

& [Stage3] is no-call probe
  + [action] create one cfg(windows) integration test
  + [action] import only the closed functions, structures, classes, and constants
  + [action] reference each function item without invocation
  + [action] compare deterministic ABI fingerprint JSON

& [Stage4] is static security proof
  + [action] scan test source for unsafe
  + [action] scan every imported function name for call-expression form
  + [action] prove no production Rust or lib export delta
  + [action] prove no forbidden write/create/delete access mask is admitted

& [Stage5] is focused and global proof
  + [action] run Windows probe in debug and overflow-checked release
  + [action] run complete workspace tests, lint, release build, rustdoc, and dependency audit
  + [action] record exact fingerprint, tests, package count, and advisory count

& [Stage6] is evidence repair
  + [action] identify predecessor manifests invalidated by Cargo or test artifacts
  + [action] regenerate only affected manifests in dependency order
  + [action] update corresponding proof digests without rewriting historical evidence
  + [action] create compile-probe evidence and proof

& [Stage7] is publication and support review
  + [action] commit implementation and closure checkpoints
  + [action] update turn, fault, file-change, readiness, conversation, and reentry records
  + [action] run completed-work support_delta and requirement_delta review

& [StopConditions] are fail-closed
  + [lock_drift] stops
  + [new_package] stops
  + [call_or_unsafe] stops
  + [production_delta] stops
  + [physical_effect] stops
  + [evidence_contradiction] stops
